      "message": "We\u0027re trying to deprecate the use of override/overridable functions.\nAt this stage it may be better to use something like:\n\nenum nissa_sub_board_type nissa_get_sb_type(void)\n{\n        static enum nissa_sub_board_type sb \u003d NISSA_SB_UNKNOWN;\n        int ret;\n        uint32_t val;\n\n        if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_BOARD_YAVIKS)) {\n               return NISSA_CB_C_A;\n        }\n...\n\nLonger term, we will need to allow for more variants that don\u0027t really\nfit the exact sub-board model, and so we may end up making that optional.\n\nThough the issue is also here that yavviks assumes the fw_config bits match the nissa common values, so strictly speaking yavviks should just have its own fw_config bits.",
